  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Governo Local e Descentraliza&#xe7;&#xe3;o</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local Government and Decentralization</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Fornecer assist&#xea;ncia t&#xe9;cnica e forma&#xe7;&#xe3;o para refor&#xe7;ar as fun&#xe7;&#xf5;es governamentais subnacionais, incluindo o desenvolvimento de or&#xe7;amentos, angaria&#xe7;&#xe3;o de receitas locais, presta&#xe7;&#xe3;o de servi&#xe7;os p&#xfa;blicos locais, planeamento comunit&#xe1;rio, participa&#xe7;&#xe3;o e implementa&#xe7;&#xe3;o de leis, regulamentos, pol&#xed;ticas e programas. Desenvolver e/ou fortalecer associa&#xe7;&#xf5;es de governos locais e/ou funcion&#xe1;rios do governo local.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide technical assistance and training to strengthen sub-national government functions, including development of budgets, local revenue raising, provision of local public services, community planning, participation, and implementation of laws, regulations, policies, and programs. Develop and/or strengthen associations of local governments and/or local government officials.</narrative>
  </description>
